Package: rsshd
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, tmux
Recommends: reptyr
Suggests: screen
Built-Using: ${misc:Built-Using}
Description: Session daemon for the rSshTerm app
 rsshd keeps terminal sessions alive in tmux while the phone is away, enforces
 idle and hard timeouts, and talks to the app over the existing SSH connection.
 It runs as a systemd user service that each user enables for themselves.
